   "type": "text",
   "textRegions": [
    {
     "characters": "1. Eiffel Tower & Trocad\u00e9ro\n Of course, no trip to Paris is complete without a photo in front of the Eiffel Tower! For the perfect shot, head to the Trocad\u00e9ro Gardens \u2014 the view is straight out of a postcard. Don\u2019t forget to stay until sunset; the tower lights up beautifully at night.",
     "formatting": {
      "fontSize": 12.470197114824577,
