   "type": "text",
   "textRegions": [
    {
     "characters": "5. Caf\u00e9 Culture & Pastries\n Paris isn\u2019t just about sights \u2014 it\u2019s about flavors. Stop at a tiny caf\u00e9 for a caf\u00e9 au lait, or try the best croissants, macarons, and \u00e9clairs. My personal favorite is sitting outside a caf\u00e9, watching the city pass by, and feeling like a true Parisian.",
